ONNX Runtime
============

Project: ONNX Runtime, https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
License: MIT (see LICENSE)

The Linux packages load a local ONNX Runtime shared library at runtime. Android
packages use the official ONNX Runtime Android AAR. The model format and the
runtime are separate works; the model license is recorded in
third_party/macbert4csc/NOTICE.
